  <title>Markup rate</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Products</gui><gui>Markup
  rate</gui></guiseq> lists every product's <gui>Markup</gui>: how far its
  price at the standard <link xref="customer_markup_percent">markup
  term</link> is above its cost, in percent. The highest markup comes first,
  so a product priced far above or below what you meant stands out.</p>

